    {
        "user": "U03JDJWSR",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1442348467.000002",
        "text": "Thank You <@U03FC5ZAK> <@U07CFCCBG> <@U04T6ATLX> (np, you can join us next time :simple_smile: )  for being there at the meeting and sharing your viewpoints - and once again 'Happy Belated Birthday' to <@U03HY4P8V>  :simple_smile: (even though you were not there but we managed to cherish ourselves) and I wish you best of luck for all of your future endeavors. \n\nNow concerning the progress of 'Printing', I met with Kevin and Quentin on today - and we discussed the following things.\n\n1 - Kevin did his pre-workout and estimated that - it will take around 4 hours (as per the specs of the printers) for each part to print (4 in total).\n\n2 - He has talked with Mr. Romain Lods (Head of Epitech Innovation Hub) concerning the more filaments which he'll need for the printing - and it will arrive somewhere in the next week (don't know the exact date).\n\n3 - I'll check-back on Friday with him to get the further progress (since he'll take a day off on thursday).\n\nAlso, they were asking me about the Email ID's of everyone and to put them in our loop of communication - so I did and send an email (covering the above mentioned points). \n\nKindly, do let me know the exact time of meeting on Saturday <@U03FC5ZAK>  - so that I can inform them at the earliest (because they have shown a great interest in 'Meiso' project).\n\nHave a nice Evening !",
        "team": "T03FC4NDZ",
        "user_team": "T03FC4NDZ",
        "source_team": "T03FC4NDZ",
